# Keep the build context lean + never leak local artifacts/secrets into images.
# The deps stage runs `pnpm install` (so node_modules must NOT be copied over
# the installed one); builds regenerate dist/.next inside the image.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets / local env — must never enter an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS + CI + tooling
.git
.github
.claude
.husky

# Example apps (examples/*) are workspace members but never deployed. The deps
# stage doesn't COPY their package.json, so pnpm install resolves the subset of
# the graph that is present; their source only enters the build stage via
# `COPY . .` and is never referenced by a runtime target.

# Misc
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
